UID:redacted@example.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261124T022356Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261123T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261123T220000
SUMMARY:8pm Pickleball - Make New Friends & Learn How to Play! 
DESCRIPTION:North Austin Pickleball Community at Pickleland\nCome play pic
 kleball and make new friends at Pickleland! 🏓\n\n\\*\\*\\* **Important:
  Please sign up on the Pickleland App ([iOS](https://pickleland.com/ios) \
 \| [Android](https://pickleland.com/android)) or [website](https://play.pi
 ckleland.com) directly.** \\*\\*\\*\n\nWe divide our open play by levels! 
 😄 (All levels welcome!)\n\nIf you've never played\, come and learn the 
 rules! We have other beginners join us every day. You don't need a paddle\
 , we have some you can rent ($10)!\n\nIf you are an avid player\, come and
  find some nice and friendly competition.\n\nIf this time doesn't work for
  you\, we are open M-F 8am to 10pm\, and Sat-Sun 8am-8pm. Find other times
  on the Pickleland App ([iOS](https://pickleland.com/ios) \\| [Android](ht
 tps://pickleland.com/android)) or [website](https://play.pickleland.com). 
 The website and app will show the most accurate roster and sign up count!\
 n\nFollow [@picklelandatx](https://www.instagram.com/picklelandatx/) for m
 ore!\n\n**⭐️ Come see why we were recently named the "Best Pickleball 
 Club" in Austin by Austin Pickleball Update and 750+ other players!**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-austin-pickleball-community-at-
 pickleland/events/317279617/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261104T020904Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T020904Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
